{"bangumi":{"date":"2009-05-24","platform":"OVA","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/39/66/37874_qB06C.jpg"},"summary":"在光坂高中空无一人的教室内，藤林椋终于鼓起勇气向被人当作不良少年的冈崎朋也表白。幸运的是，她的爱意没有落于虚空，得到了冈崎热情而肯定的回应。两人自此开始交往，望着沉浸在幸福中的妹妹，藤林杏心中自是无法道出的复杂感受。某个明媚的假日，冈崎和杏在公园不期而遇。杏半开玩笑地教冈崎把自己当作椋练习接吻，谁知这一幕却被同学看见，第二天便在学校内传得风言风语。为了消除谣言，杏甚至假装和春原阳平交往。甜蜜又青涩的学生时代，说不清道不明的爱恋情怀……","name":"CLANNAD 〜AFTER STORY〜もうひとつの世界 杏編","name_cn":"CLANNAD ～AFTER STORY～另一个世界 杏篇","tags":[{"name":"京阿尼","count":2106,"total_count":216571},{"name":"OVA","count":1813,"total_count":370449},{"name":"Clannad","count":1774,"total_count":21093},{"name":"key","count":1481,"total_count":47431},{"name":"GAL改","count":1007,"total_count":79528},{"name":"校园","count":781,"total_count":467349},{"name":"2009","count":779,"total_count":39815},{"name":"杏篇","count":747,"total_count":747},{"name":"麻枝准","count":732,"total_count":23515},{"name":"催泪","count":686,"total_count":61238},{"name":"治愈","count":520,"total_count":307276},{"name":"游戏改","count":473,"total_count":165268},{"name":"恋爱","count":449,"total_count":579422},{"name":"短发杏","count":281,"total_count":281},{"name":"石原立也","count":237,"total_count":16368},{"name":"京都动画","count":154,"total_count":33499},{"name":"日本","count":112,"total_count":310164},{"name":"京都","count":89,"total_count":7711},{"name":"2009年5月","count":47,"total_count":133},{"name":"STORY～もうひとつの世界","count":46,"total_count":46},{"name":"京都アニメーション","count":45,"total_count":6541},{"name":"2009年","count":40,"total_count":2046},{"name":"日常","count":26,"total_count":412315},{"name":"神作","count":22,"total_count":48268},{"name":"番外","count":19,"total_count":4418},{"name":"人生","count":18,"total_count":12058},{"name":"TV","count":16,"total_count":